{
  "schema_version": "intent_set.v1",
  "agent_id": "recouvrement",
  "set_version": "2026-08-23.1",
  "description": "Labeled layer-1 understanding referent for the Recouvrement operator agent (ADR 0053 §7). 5 intents × 3 languages × 8 cases. Labels are what a human reader understands the operator to be asking — deliberately independent of any classifier's answer. Each cell mixes canonical phrasings (word lists should catch them) and paraphrases without magic words (the cases that justify an LLM, labeled truthfully either way). Fields are labeled only where the utterance states them and never where the value would be clock-dependent (\"maintenant\"/\"now\"/\"jetzt\").",
